  },
  {
    title: 'MEMORIES THAT LAST',
    description: 'We help you preserve the memories of your special day for years to come.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-gold-on-blue" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12z" /></svg>`
